<p>Enhancements to your mecharachnid combat skill increases your melee and ranged evasion by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 16%, 20%, 24%, 26%,</acronym> and causes you to automatically strike adjacent enemies with your tailsaw for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">94%, 113%, 127%, 139%, 150%</acronym> damage each turn.</p>